nment.According to the \uc2 IMF\uc2  statement, the Argentinean government requested that one-third of this support be disbursed with the approval of the program and that half of that amount (US$ 7.5 billion) be available for budget support.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020180614ee6d00035\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
