\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Argentine peso picks up after  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 215 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Juni 2018\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 The Argentine peso led gains among emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday after it was said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold dollars to shore up the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  after falling to a record low this week.\par \par \uc2 The peso appreciated 0.8% to 25.84 per dollar at noon on Tuesday after two loss sessions. \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets on Tuesday for the first time since the announcement last week of a US $ 50 billion credit line from the \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Despite today's gains, the peso has lost almost 28% of its value so far this year, making it the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  with the worst performance in emerging markets.\par \par \uc2 As part of the agreement with the Fund, \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President \uc2 Federico Sturzenegger\uc2  said last week that he would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  less in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets after three weeks of keeping the peso below 25 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 The Central will announce a decision on its key interest rate at 5 pm Buenos Aires time. It is expected to maintain its benchmark rate at 40 percent, according to a Bloomberg survey of 21 analysts.\par \par \uc2 The Argentine peso entry rebounds after \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was first published in La Tercera.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020180612ee6c003vn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
