\par\par \b \uc2 Argentina's Bonds, Stocks Close Higher; Merval Up 0.8%\b0\par\par\uc2 By Ken Parks   \par \uc2 369 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 August 2012\par 23:18\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 BUENOS AIRES--Argentina's bonds and stocks closed higher Wednesday, as investors ventured into the local market in the absence of negative news from the U.S. and Europe.\par \par \uc2 Adrian Mayoral, a trader at his family's brokerage, said assets have benefited from less volatility in offshore markets and the government's $2.2 billion payment of the Boden 2012 bond two weeks ago. But Europe and local politics are headwinds, he said.\par \par \uc2 "Uncertainty means that [asset] prices are very cheap. But we don't have a lot of conviction," he said. "We are at a good point in time to build positions with prudence."\par \par \uc2 Turnover on the local fixed-income market was 874.6 million pesos ($190 million), accounting for almost 76% of the total volume of securities traded on the exchange.\par \par \uc2 The Bonar X closed 1.4% higher at ARS520.40, yielding 4.53%\par \par \uc2 The Boden 2015 rose 1.3% to ARS585.75, and the Bonar 2013 closed 1.3% higher at ARS657.75.\par \par \uc2 The 2035 peso-denominated GDP warrant closed 0.3% lower at ARS12.859.\par \par \uc2 The peso closed at ARS4.6080 to the U.S. dollar on the MAE \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  wholesale market.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, buying dollars to build its international reserves and to keep the peso on a slow path of depreciation against the dollar.\par \par \uc2 According to the newspaper El Cronista, the dollar fetched ARS6.35 on the black market Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 The Argentine government's strict \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  controls have forced many individuals to seek dollars on the black market.\par \par \uc2 Argentina's benchmark Merval stock index closed 0.8% higher at 2440.35 on volume of ARS42.4 million.\par \par \uc2 Mayoral said the expiration of options Thursday could make for lively trading in local stocks.\par \par \uc2 Steel-tube maker \uc2 Tenaris SA\uc2  (TS, TEN.MI) rose 0.9% to ARS131.30; banking group \uc2 Grupo Financiero Galicia SA\uc2  (GGAL, GGAL.BA) added 0.3% to ARS3.20; and steel company Siderar SA (ERAR.BA) gained 0.7% to ARS1.47.\par \par \uc2 Write to Ken Parks at ken.parks@dowjones.com. [ 15-08-12 2118GMT ]\par \par \uc2 5054   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120815e88f000zh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
