\par\par \b \uc2 Argentina's Bonds, Stocks End July Lower Ahead of  \highlight22\uc2 Central-Bank \highlight\uc2  News\b0\par\par\uc2 By Ken Parks   \par \uc2 565 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 Juli 2012\par 23:50\par \uc2 Dow Jones Business News\par \uc2 DJON\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 BUENOS AIRES--Argentina's bonds and stocks fell in the last trading day of July as investors waited to see if the U.S. Federal Reserve and \uc2 European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will announce further stimulus measures later this week.\par \par \uc2 Turnover on the local fixed-income market was 598.7 million pesos ($130.6 million) on Tuesday, accounting for about 71% of the total volume of securities traded on the exchange.\par \par \uc2 "Events abroad hit us [Tuesday]. There weren't any local data that hit the [Argentine] markets," said trader Francisco Marra at Bull Market Brokers, who sees value in U.S. dollar-denominated GDP warrants and bank stocks.\par \par \uc2 European and U.S. stock markets closed lower as investors fretted that central banks might not deliver enough stimulus to boost the global economy.\par \par \uc2 The Bonar X closed 0.5% lower in price terms at ARS508.00, yielding 4.91%.\par \par \uc2 The Bocon 2014 fell 0.5% to ARS92.00, yielding 19.10%.\par \par \uc2 The Bonar 2015 closed 0.5% higher at ARS128.20, yielding 17.17%, while the Boden 2015 fell 0.5% to ARS572.75.\par \par \uc2 The 2035 peso-denominated GDP warrant closed 1.5% higher at ARS12.45.\par \par \uc2 The peso weakened to close at ARS4.5850 to the U.S. dollar on the MAE \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  wholesale market, compared with ARS4.5750 Monday.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, buying dollars to build its international reserves and keeping the peso on a slow path of depreciation against the dollar.\par \par \uc2 The peso lost about 9.6% of its value against the dollar in the last 12 months as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  allowed the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to depreciate at a swifter pace to help exporters struggling with annual inflation that is thought to be running above 20%.\par \par \uc2 In comparison, the peso weakened 7.6% versus the dollar last year.\par \par \uc2 Local brokerage Puente said in a note to clients the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was absent during the session in the face of limited movements in the exchange rate and volume of just $210 million on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate market.\par \par \uc2 Since early May, the authorities have blocked most requests to buy dollars, which has caused the gap between the regulated spot-market and black-market rates to widen.\par \par \uc2 According to the newspaper El Cronista, the dollar was selling for between ARS6.36 and ARS6.45 on the black market Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 Argentina's benchmark Merval stock index closed 0.6% lower at 2420.41 on volume of ARS30.9 million. The Merval rose 2.3% this month, helping to trim its year-to-date loss to 2.5%.\par \par \uc2 State-controlled oil-and-gas company \uc2 YPF SA\uc2  (YPFD.BA, \uc2 YPF\uc2 ) fell 4.2% to ARS77.50; steelmaker \uc2 Siderar SAIC\uc2  (ERAR.BA) fell 1.3% to ARS1.54; and steel-tube maker \uc2 Tenaris SA\uc2  (TS, TS.BA) closed 1.5% lower at ARS128.00.\par \par \uc2 Among gainers, banking concern \uc2 Banco Macro SA\uc2  (BMA, BMA.BA) rose 1.1% to ARS8.14 and phone company \uc2 Telecom Argentina SA\uc2  (TEO, TECO2.BA) closed 3.9% higher at ARS16.10.\par \par \uc2 Telecom reported second-quarter net profit of ARS586 million, down 8% from a year ago.\par \par \uc2 Write to Ken Parks at ken.parks@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 Subscribe to WSJ: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://online.wsj.com?mod=djnwires"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://online.wsj.com?mod=djnwires}}}\uc2  [ 07-31-12 1750ET ]\par \par \uc2 5054   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJON000020120731e87v0009x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
